  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zDxHgP6.png\" alt=\"德里克坐在品质零件的宝座上\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /></p>\n<p><br /><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"时尚的 Discord 横幅按钮\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"时尚的 Patreon 横幅按钮\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" alt=\"时尚的 TEOM 横幅按钮\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><br /><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wO7SxtPEG7A?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe><br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hokDQXd.png\" alt=\"官方 UNU 包\" width=\"700\" height=\"52\" /><br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hXzPxBhhmY8\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bih0TeG.png\" alt=\"间隔图片\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LEbdi0V.png\" alt=\"UNU 民用包\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-military-pack-for-mts\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xcDyZDh.png\" alt=\"UNU 军用图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSIuQFB.png\" alt=\"UNUverse 图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g6QdnguNEYU\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aKb9C5J.png\" alt=\"右侧标题图\" width=\"70\" height=\"140\" /></a><br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ntUooe7.png\" alt=\"合作伙伴包横幅\" width=\"700\" height=\"52\" /><br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dkz-automotive-industries\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8yW6BWm.png\" alt=\"DKZ 图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-unu-bjorns-customs\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jZ9oDLq.png\" alt=\"Bjorn 图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randall-agriculture-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5aoUbYG.png\" alt=\"沉浸式农业图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/syndicate-motor-foundry\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nGhvvp8.png\" alt=\"辛迪加图标\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ea6py9q46QU\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aKb9C5J.png\" alt=\"右侧标题图\" width=\"70\" height=\"140\" /></a><br /><br /></p>\n<p>UNU Parts 需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transport Simulator<br /><br /></a></p>\n<p>UNU Parts 为其他 MTS 模组包提供了多种优质零件供使用！<br /><br /></p>\n<p>从引擎、车轮和座椅，到公交广告、货运集装箱和履带！UNU Parts 包拥有您所需的一切 Quality MTS Parts&trade;️！如果您需要的 MTS 包零件我们目前没有提供，我们会为您添加！我们很自豪能为市面上最优秀、规模最大的 MTS 模组包提供零件！<br /><br />UNU 与以下官方 UNU 模组包搭配效果最佳：<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\">UNU 民用模组包</a> - 塞满了各种必备的优质载具！<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-military-pack-for-mts\">UNU 军用模组包</a> - 捍卫黑瑟恩帝国！<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\">扩展 UNUverse 模组包</a> - 更多独特载具，丰富强大的 UNUverse 世界观！<br /><br />试试这些优秀的 UNU 认证内容包！<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dkz-automotive-industries\">DKZ 工业汽车分部</a> -&nbsp;丰富的复古与经典载具合集！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iv-mts-unu-bjorns-customs\">Bjorn's Customs</a> -&nbsp;Bjorn's Customs 是 UNU Civil 和 UNU Parts 的附加组件。它包含适用于 Contractor 和 Contractor XL 的改装零件。<br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randall-agriculture-pack\">IV Farming</a> - 一堆必备的农业配件！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/syndicate-motor-foundry\">Syndicate Motor Foundry</a> -&nbsp;专为 Immersive Vehicles 打造的内容包，带来全新品牌的载具与零件！<br /><br /><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\">加入我们的 Discord！<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\">在 Patreon 上支持 UNU！<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\">加入官方服务器！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/drprofluigi\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f49d125b-80a8-4522-a819-1922543fb769.png\" alt=\"特别鸣谢 Bisecthosting 赞助\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\" /></a></p>",
